                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "As someone who considers time-management games my absolute favorite genre, Dead Hungry Diner completely hit the spot for me.\n\nSteam Deck Performance: It runs great on the Steam Deck, but here is a quick tip: skip the thumbsticks and buttons! Tap directly on the touch screen as if you were playing on a mobile phone—it makes the fast-paced gameplay feel intuitive and responsive.\n\nFor Achievement Hunters: Getting 100% achievements is surprisingly engaging. Once you learn the rhythm and a few neat tricks to speed up level clear times, unlocking everything becomes a delightfully addicting challenge rather than a tedious grind. If you love quick-thinking strategy games, definitely give this one a shot!",
